# Files excluded from the deployment upload.
#
# public/ was 260MB, which made every deploy upload ~274MB and take minutes.
# Everything listed here was verified unreferenced by the app before being
# added — grep src/ and workshop-helper/ before adding anything new, because
# an ignored file under public/ is not served at all and will 404 in prod.
#
# Referenced large assets are deliberately NOT listed (they must keep
# shipping), e.g.:
#   public/hackathons/innovation-hackathon/hackathon-image-gen.png  (21MB)
#   public/headshots/Berto Mill_Headshot.jpg                        (11MB)
# Both are worth compressing at some point, but that is a content change,
# not an ignore rule.

# --- Source art for social posts: generated locally, never served ---
# Only referenced by its own generator scripts inside the same folder.
public/linkedin-graphic/

# --- Print-resolution event banners (26MB) ---
# The web-sized banner actually used by the app is the .avif in this folder,
# which stays. These two are the large-format print originals.
public/event-banners/Makerslounge Banner.png
public/event-banners/Makerslounge Banner - 33.5x80 PopUp.png

# --- Poster render output (13MB), produced by poster/generate_poster.py ---
public/dba5992d-1304-4369-9497-02c9b26fb855.png

# --- Unused hero video (4.7MB) ---
public/hero-bg.mp4

# --- Hackathon walkthrough recording (58MB), the single largest asset ---
# Not linked from any page. If this ever needs to be shown, host it on a
# video service rather than shipping it in the bundle.
public/hackathons/innovation-hackathon/Obtain Credits.mp4

# --- Working directories that are never part of the build ---
poster/
app-store-screenshots/
ios/
